1.0.5
-----
- Fix crashes on Adreno GPUs by falling back to CPU before inference
- Recover from Vulkan inference failures by retrying on CPU

1.0.4
-----
- Update whisper.cpp to 080bbbe8 (6 months of upstream improvements)
- Import your own whisper ggml models from device storage
- Fix slow GPU transcription on some Mali devices (e.g. Mali-G715)
- Fix transcription dropping part of a chunk when VAD is enabled
- Fix hang at 0% on corrupt or unsupported audio files
- Turn turbo mode off automatically when the extra CPU model fails to load
- Hide the live recording mode, too experimental

1.0.3
-----
- Improve UI (move status cards down, add file name in status bar)
- Add Listen mode (review and play your transcription)
- Fix hallucinations when VAD is enabled (was on by default)
- Add a setting to enable/disable VAD

1.0.2
-----
- Resolves Android Vitals warnings about deprecated edge-to-edge APIs
- add v8fp16_dotprod for arm64 (faster CPU processing on modern devices)

1.0.1
-----
- Reduce ggml Vulkan queue priority to make the UI more responsive.

1.0.0
-----
First release.
